1
00:00:00,979 --> 00:00:04,373
(Episode 14)

2
00:00:23,417 --> 00:00:24,883
- Eun Seo.
- Jun Seo.

3
00:00:38,104 --> 00:00:40,132
I can't come for three days.
Will you be okay?

4
00:00:45,259 --> 00:00:47,971
No, I'll come the day after tomorrow.

5
00:00:51,641 --> 00:00:54,374
I'm leaving. See you in two days.

6
00:01:05,362 --> 00:01:06,971
No, I don't think so.

7
00:01:06,971 --> 00:01:09,044
I'll come tomorrow. I'm coming tomorrow.

8
00:01:11,537 --> 00:01:14,869
Take care of things at work,
and drive safely.

9
00:01:19,672 --> 00:01:21,086
When you say that...

10
00:01:23,146 --> 00:01:25,075
I might wish for something again.

11
00:01:26,562 --> 00:01:30,009
I would dream you said "drive safely"
every morning,

12
00:01:30,009 --> 00:01:31,526
and gave me a kiss,

13
00:01:31,526 --> 00:01:34,314
then I'll be fully confident
to do anything.

14
00:01:44,893 --> 00:01:48,231
I'm going to visit your family this time,
and...

15
00:01:48,231 --> 00:01:49,231
No.

16
00:01:49,973 --> 00:01:52,370
You can't say anything before
Jun Seo leaves. Never.

17
00:01:57,287 --> 00:01:58,287
I'm sorry.

18
00:02:00,399 --> 00:02:01,509
It's okay.

19
00:02:02,402 --> 00:02:05,283
I won't say anything.
I won't tell Jun Seo.

20
00:02:08,643 --> 00:02:09,781
I'm shrewd, aren't I?

21
00:02:12,866 --> 00:02:17,722
Jun Seo has only a few days
before he leaves.

22
00:02:17,722 --> 00:02:19,270
Don't you want to meet him
for the last time?

23
00:02:24,090 --> 00:02:25,090
Okay.

24
00:02:26,227 --> 00:02:27,227
I should get going.

25
00:02:34,355 --> 00:02:35,355
Thanks.

26
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:38,500
Yes.

27
00:02:40,309 --> 00:02:41,309
Okay.

28
00:02:43,885 --> 00:02:44,885
Sure.

29
00:03:25,059 --> 00:03:26,893
I'm sorry, Tae Seok.

30
00:03:28,509 --> 00:03:30,472
I'll be out for just one day.

31
00:03:33,797 --> 00:03:35,784
Because it would be the last time,

32
00:03:37,182 --> 00:03:39,700
and it is to say goodbye,

33
00:03:39,700 --> 00:03:40,976
I just need a day.

34
00:03:47,124 --> 00:03:48,531
Yes, okay.

35
00:03:48,531 --> 00:03:50,788
It wouldn't take long since
it's just a venous blood sampling.

36
00:03:50,788 --> 00:03:52,572
Please book a hotel near the hospital.

37
00:03:52,572 --> 00:03:55,429
Her mother and brother are coming first.

38
00:03:55,429 --> 00:03:56,784
Yes.

39
00:03:56,784 --> 00:03:58,502
Yes, I'll call you later.

40
00:04:05,496 --> 00:04:08,857
There is no better option
other than a bone marrow transplant.

41
00:04:09,608 --> 00:04:14,420
We should ask her family members first
to get tested.

42
00:04:14,420 --> 00:04:17,006
Can't I do it? Is mine not going to work?

43
00:04:18,994 --> 00:04:21,901
We wouldn't worry
if anyone could be a donor.

44
00:04:23,122 --> 00:04:25,243
Even though the patient doesn't want it,

45
00:04:25,243 --> 00:04:27,264
please contact her family
as soon as possible.

46
00:04:41,104 --> 00:04:42,660
Are you leaving today?

47
00:04:44,193 --> 00:04:45,193
Yes.

48
00:04:46,408 --> 00:04:48,182
As for everything left here,

49
00:04:49,819 --> 00:04:51,280
you can throw them away.

50
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:52,858
Why is that? Are you not coming back?

51
00:04:53,545 --> 00:04:55,634
No. I will leave it as it is.

52
00:04:56,712 --> 00:04:59,988
Come back with Eun Seo next time.
Will you?

53
00:05:59,326 --> 00:06:01,977
What are you doing here?
Didn't you go to work?

54
00:06:03,487 --> 00:06:06,424
You don't need to do that.
It can splatter on your clothes.

55
00:06:06,424 --> 00:06:08,370
It did already.

56
00:06:14,215 --> 00:06:15,264
What?

57
00:06:16,233 --> 00:06:18,050
Did I get something on my face?

58
00:06:19,013 --> 00:06:21,038
You've gotten soft.

59
00:06:21,038 --> 00:06:23,322
You used to scold me...

60
00:06:23,322 --> 00:06:25,294
when I wasn't helping you at your store.

61
00:06:28,811 --> 00:06:30,150
Why are you here?

62
00:06:31,036 --> 00:06:33,770
Your daughter, Eun Seo, asked me...

63
00:06:33,770 --> 00:06:35,069
to look after you.

64
00:06:37,874 --> 00:06:41,883
That's nonsense.
She should mind her own business.

65
00:06:41,883 --> 00:06:43,549
She's not treating you very well, either.

66
00:06:47,388 --> 00:06:48,534
Is that why you're here?

67
00:06:49,052 --> 00:06:51,270
I just stopped by.

68
00:06:53,027 --> 00:06:55,940
Stay at the store.
I'm getting vegetable oil.

69
00:06:55,940 --> 00:06:58,387
I'll go. I can drive to get it.

70
00:06:58,387 --> 00:07:01,233
No, I'll go. I need to buy
some other ingredients as well.

71
00:07:01,233 --> 00:07:03,470
It's fine. I'll go and get some.

72
00:07:12,083 --> 00:07:13,117
Poor things,

73
00:07:14,842 --> 00:07:17,277
both Eun Seo and you.

74
00:07:46,757 --> 00:07:47,913
Hi, hello.

75
00:07:49,079 --> 00:07:50,890
You're here.

76
00:07:55,838 --> 00:07:57,065
It's a humble house.

77
00:08:02,477 --> 00:08:06,514
Are you coming from Seoul?

78
00:08:09,270 --> 00:08:13,521
How is Eun Seo doing?

79
00:08:17,325 --> 00:08:22,161
She's not giving me her phone number.

80
00:08:23,966 --> 00:08:25,910
Is she doing well?

81
00:08:27,191 --> 00:08:30,041
How is her new job?

82
00:08:31,655 --> 00:08:32,721
Ms. Soon Im.

83
00:08:38,222 --> 00:08:39,593
Is something wrong?

84
00:08:41,997 --> 00:08:45,360
Did something happen to Eun Seo?

85
00:08:47,525 --> 00:08:48,857
Look at me.

86
00:08:49,943 --> 00:08:51,234
Please tell me.

87
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,946
Tell me.

88
00:08:56,407 --> 00:08:58,647
What's going on?

89
00:08:58,647 --> 00:09:02,368
What happened to Eun Seo?

90
00:09:02,368 --> 00:09:03,513
Eun Seo...

91
00:09:06,033 --> 00:09:07,154
is sick.

92
00:09:10,016 --> 00:09:11,236
She is very sick.

93
00:09:14,487 --> 00:09:15,556
Is she...

94
00:09:19,250 --> 00:09:20,660
It's cancer, Ms. Soon Im.

95
00:09:22,609 --> 00:09:23,679
She has cancer.

96
00:09:28,088 --> 00:09:30,666
She needs a bone marrow transplant,

97
00:09:30,666 --> 00:09:32,685
and the doctor insisted that
her family members get tested first.

98
00:09:36,850 --> 00:09:38,115
That's why I came here.

99
00:09:53,486 --> 00:09:56,383
What a cruel man.

100
00:09:58,197 --> 00:10:01,991
He had given me so much
of a hard time before he died.

101
00:10:03,238 --> 00:10:06,494
And as if that wasn't enough,
he even gave her cancer.

102
00:10:08,220 --> 00:10:10,415
What an evil man.

103
00:10:20,260 --> 00:10:21,285
Tae Seok.

104
00:10:22,531 --> 00:10:23,631
Is it true?

105
00:10:24,771 --> 00:10:27,389
Sin Ae.

106
00:10:27,916 --> 00:10:30,350
Does Eun Seo have cancer?

107
00:10:31,748 --> 00:10:33,000
Does she really have cancer?

108
00:10:36,300 --> 00:10:39,295
Tae Seok, tell me.

109
00:10:39,295 --> 00:10:42,540
I think I deserve to know.

110
00:10:42,540 --> 00:10:43,623
Tell me.

111
00:10:46,508 --> 00:10:47,983
If Eun Seo has cancer,

112
00:10:49,063 --> 00:10:52,167
Mom, Dad, and Jun Seo,

113
00:10:53,052 --> 00:10:54,559
what about them?

114
00:10:56,340 --> 00:10:58,860
Don't tell them.
Don't say anything to anyone.

115
00:10:58,860 --> 00:11:02,337
Don't tell Jun Seo.

116
00:11:03,013 --> 00:11:04,558
- Tae Seok.
- That's what Eun Seo wants.

117
00:11:04,558 --> 00:11:07,930
So, you should forget what you heard.

118
00:11:09,157 --> 00:11:10,708
If you tell Jun Seo about this,

119
00:11:11,968 --> 00:11:13,266
I won't ever forgive you.

120
00:12:11,686 --> 00:12:12,886
Wait, please stop.

121
00:13:12,860 --> 00:13:13,860
Eun Seo.

122
00:13:15,925 --> 00:13:17,129
Why can I...

123
00:13:19,093 --> 00:13:22,088
Why can I not get away from you?

124
00:14:17,439 --> 00:14:18,552
No.

125
00:14:23,314 --> 00:14:24,365
Eun Seo.

126
00:14:37,870 --> 00:14:42,546
Why did you let him travel when there are
only a few days left before leaving?

127
00:14:43,431 --> 00:14:46,615
I let him because we have a few days.

128
00:14:46,615 --> 00:14:49,154
So that he can do anything he wants
without regrets before we leave.

129
00:14:50,383 --> 00:14:52,193
I wish you could have gotten married
before you leave.

130
00:14:56,863 --> 00:14:58,122
Eat it, Sin Ae.

131
00:15:05,335 --> 00:15:06,335
Mom.

132
00:15:08,624 --> 00:15:09,674
Why are you...

133
00:15:10,279 --> 00:15:11,279
Hello.

134
00:15:12,767 --> 00:15:14,051
Hello.

135
00:15:14,051 --> 00:15:16,309
What are you doing?
Are you out of your mind?

136
00:15:16,309 --> 00:15:17,799
Why did you come here?

137
00:15:19,660 --> 00:15:22,429
What's going on?

138
00:15:23,596 --> 00:15:26,310
This is all I have.

139
00:15:26,926 --> 00:15:28,686
What is this?

140
00:15:29,188 --> 00:15:31,443
It's not a lot of money,

141
00:15:31,443 --> 00:15:34,848
but this is all I have. Please use this.

142
00:15:35,964 --> 00:15:37,935
I know it costs so much money.

143
00:15:38,635 --> 00:15:41,295
Her dad died from that disease, too.

144
00:15:42,244 --> 00:15:44,493
Please help, for old time's sake...

145
00:15:44,493 --> 00:15:45,660
Mom.

146
00:15:46,901 --> 00:15:48,079
What do you mean?

147
00:15:50,268 --> 00:15:51,398
What are you talking about?

148
00:15:53,132 --> 00:15:55,115
Please save her.

149
00:15:55,115 --> 00:15:56,562
My Eun Seo...

150
00:15:57,233 --> 00:15:58,620
My Eun Seo is...

151
00:15:59,543 --> 00:16:01,740
She is dying from the same disease.

152
00:16:03,536 --> 00:16:04,536
Mom.

153
00:16:07,088 --> 00:16:11,395
Please let her get the surgery at least.

154
00:16:14,377 --> 00:16:17,050
I don't have anyone to ask for help.

155
00:16:17,712 --> 00:16:22,057
You used to be her parents,

156
00:16:22,057 --> 00:16:23,249
so please save her.

157
00:16:24,134 --> 00:16:26,375
You save her, please.

158
00:16:26,375 --> 00:16:29,009
Save her.

159
00:16:29,471 --> 00:16:31,196
What do you mean by that?

160
00:16:32,224 --> 00:16:33,750
What do you mean by "save her?"

161
00:16:35,086 --> 00:16:36,086
Whom should we save?

162
00:16:37,261 --> 00:16:38,832
Save her.

163
00:16:39,804 --> 00:16:41,227
- Mom.
- Ms. Kyung Ha.

164
00:16:42,815 --> 00:16:43,938
Mom.

165
00:17:26,411 --> 00:17:27,749
What should I do?

166
00:17:31,901 --> 00:17:33,125
What should I do?

167
00:17:35,836 --> 00:17:37,016
It's up to you.

168
00:17:40,411 --> 00:17:44,775
I'm thinking only about
what I should do as well.

169
00:17:49,516 --> 00:17:50,960
If Jun Seo gets to know about this...

170
00:17:53,060 --> 00:17:56,320
If he gets to know...

171
00:17:56,320 --> 00:17:57,691
Don't tell Jun Seo.

172
00:17:59,817 --> 00:18:01,186
Isn't that what you want, too?

173
00:18:03,256 --> 00:18:04,556
I haven't told him.

174
00:18:06,689 --> 00:18:08,802
Why haven't I?

175
00:18:08,802 --> 00:18:10,891
Eun Seo doesn't want him to know it.
That's what she wants.

176
00:18:10,891 --> 00:18:13,565
My only excuse for not telling him
is that it's what Eun Seo wants.

177
00:18:18,074 --> 00:18:21,148
Let's think only about
what we want for ourselves.

178
00:18:22,681 --> 00:18:23,949
I will think of myself.

179
00:18:27,264 --> 00:18:28,731
What should I do?

180
00:18:41,707 --> 00:18:42,965
Aren't you cold?

181
00:18:43,771 --> 00:18:44,771
No.

182
00:18:46,722 --> 00:18:49,037
Are you leaving soon?

183
00:18:54,124 --> 00:18:57,598
Yes, I have only a few days.

184
00:19:00,611 --> 00:19:02,750
I wanted to come here before leaving.

185
00:19:06,243 --> 00:19:12,156
I wanted to tell you something here.

186
00:19:12,156 --> 00:19:15,972
"Goodbye." "See you again."

187
00:19:15,972 --> 00:19:17,925
I was going to say those lines.

188
00:19:19,011 --> 00:19:23,630
If you say that here, I wouldn't hear you.

189
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:26,229
You wouldn't?

190
00:19:28,301 --> 00:19:29,479
You're mean.

191
00:19:30,627 --> 00:19:34,141
I thought you would always hear me
if I said something.

192
00:19:35,276 --> 00:19:37,962
So, when we were apart,

193
00:19:37,962 --> 00:19:40,502
I've always talked to you.

194
00:19:42,372 --> 00:19:43,879
Didn't you hear that?

195
00:19:48,572 --> 00:19:49,847
I didn't hear it.

196
00:19:53,219 --> 00:19:55,846
I heard it. Of course, I heard it.

197
00:19:57,771 --> 00:19:59,622
You said you missed me.

198
00:20:01,555 --> 00:20:02,555
Yes.

199
00:20:04,499 --> 00:20:09,060
Longing to see you, missing you,

200
00:20:10,650 --> 00:20:12,397
and missing you so much.

201
00:20:16,411 --> 00:20:21,518
Because I always miss you
even when I'm looking at you.

202
00:20:30,305 --> 00:20:32,341
Where are you now?

203
00:20:34,305 --> 00:20:35,500
Are you in Seoul?

204
00:20:40,609 --> 00:20:42,644
Can we not talk about that?

205
00:20:46,938 --> 00:20:48,628
Acting as if we're in a dream,

206
00:20:49,986 --> 00:20:52,115
can't we just look at each other
like this?

207
00:21:06,690 --> 00:21:10,964
Let's stay like this just for a day.

208
00:21:12,610 --> 00:21:13,724
Just for one day.

209
00:21:16,498 --> 00:21:18,150
Only one day in my life.

210
00:21:20,705 --> 00:21:22,296
Not only one day,

211
00:21:24,973 --> 00:21:26,600
but I wish I could stay like this forever.

212
00:21:32,319 --> 00:21:34,414
Or I want to die like this.

213
00:21:36,636 --> 00:21:39,986
No.

214
00:21:41,599 --> 00:21:43,131
You can't.

215
00:21:47,119 --> 00:21:51,883
I'll die first. Don't you remember that?

216
00:21:58,281 --> 00:21:59,428
Jun Seo.

217
00:22:01,752 --> 00:22:06,571
We'll love each other forever,
only in our hearts.

218
00:22:08,112 --> 00:22:09,404
Only in our hearts.

219
00:22:12,792 --> 00:22:14,715
We'll love each other in our hearts...

220
00:22:17,007 --> 00:22:21,354
and not hurt Yu Mi and Tae Seok,

221
00:22:22,760 --> 00:22:24,764
who love us.

222
00:22:27,840 --> 00:22:29,594
Who cares if it is only pretense?

223
00:22:31,656 --> 00:22:32,946
Let's just lie.

224
00:22:35,967 --> 00:22:38,052
And be happy, all of us.

225
00:22:42,216 --> 00:22:43,667
Even if we run away...

226
00:22:46,767 --> 00:22:48,595
Even if we run away, we can't be together.

227
00:22:51,535 --> 00:22:53,146
So, I will have only your heart.

228
00:22:57,199 --> 00:23:03,085
You already took mine.

229
00:23:09,952 --> 00:23:11,379
You already...

230
00:23:15,187 --> 00:23:16,773
have mine, too.

231
00:24:12,729 --> 00:24:14,990
What's wrong? Are you tired?

232
00:24:15,747 --> 00:24:18,767
No, I just fell.

233
00:24:18,767 --> 00:24:20,552
You're clumsy. Let's go.

234
00:24:25,614 --> 00:24:26,614
Eun Seo.

235
00:24:28,557 --> 00:24:31,168
Jun Seo, can you give me a piggyback ride?

236
00:24:32,719 --> 00:24:33,769
Give me a piggyback ride.

237
00:24:35,757 --> 00:24:36,757
Okay.

238
00:24:39,590 --> 00:24:40,590
Hop on.

239
00:24:46,562 --> 00:24:47,879
Why are you so quiet?

240
00:24:50,210 --> 00:24:51,470
Because I might be heavy.

241
00:24:55,027 --> 00:24:58,205
Jun Seo, I love you.

242
00:25:04,507 --> 00:25:05,982
I love you, Jun Seo.

243
00:25:09,803 --> 00:25:11,093
You're strange.

244
00:25:13,188 --> 00:25:14,663
Jun Seo, do you know that?

245
00:25:16,580 --> 00:25:21,549
You've told other people you love me,

246
00:25:23,090 --> 00:25:27,886
and yet you've never told me that
looking into my eyes.

247
00:25:29,803 --> 00:25:30,803
What did you say?

248
00:25:32,347 --> 00:25:35,460
Eun Seo, I love you.

249
00:25:35,460 --> 00:25:37,518
You've never told me that.

250
00:25:41,387 --> 00:25:44,358
Eun Seo, I...

251
00:25:45,076 --> 00:25:47,862
No.

252
00:25:49,970 --> 00:25:55,068
Not now. Tell me later.

253
00:25:55,068 --> 00:25:56,149
Later.

254
00:25:59,123 --> 00:26:00,468
Later when?

255
00:26:03,939 --> 00:26:05,349
The day when we meet again?

256
00:26:05,914 --> 00:26:06,914
Yes.

257
00:26:08,291 --> 00:26:10,350
Yes, when we meet again,

258
00:26:12,906 --> 00:26:14,932
so until then, you must practice
saying it nicely.

259
00:26:17,299 --> 00:26:19,174
Then, tell me when we'll meet.

260
00:26:23,434 --> 00:26:25,322
Until then...

261
00:26:27,344 --> 00:26:29,618
I'll be waiting for you,
looking forward to that.

262
00:26:32,223 --> 00:26:33,715
I promise to wait for you.

263
00:26:35,838 --> 00:26:36,937
I'll be waiting for you.

264
00:26:38,383 --> 00:26:40,497
To hear you tell me you love me,

265
00:26:41,783 --> 00:26:43,673
I'm going to wait for that.

266
00:28:02,559 --> 00:28:07,209
We love each other forever,
only in our hearts.

267
00:28:08,983 --> 00:28:10,210
Only in our hearts.

268
00:28:16,746 --> 00:28:18,475
We'll love each other in our hearts...

269
00:28:20,936 --> 00:28:25,283
and not hurt Yu Mi and Tae Seok,

270
00:28:26,704 --> 00:28:28,548
who love us.

271
00:28:31,791 --> 00:28:33,482
Who cares if it is a pretense?

272
00:28:35,528 --> 00:28:36,715
Let's just lie.

273
00:28:39,896 --> 00:28:41,850
And be happy, all of us.

274
00:28:45,889 --> 00:28:47,140
Are you going to the hospital?

275
00:28:51,234 --> 00:28:52,234
Yes.

276
00:28:53,394 --> 00:28:56,661
I'll see how her condition is.

277
00:28:57,499 --> 00:28:59,165
Also, I'm worried about Eun Seo.

278
00:29:00,889 --> 00:29:04,075
You shouldn't worry about it too much.

279
00:29:04,075 --> 00:29:06,972
I'll call you when I see the doctor.

280
00:29:08,250 --> 00:29:10,078
I'll go with you.

281
00:29:10,078 --> 00:29:11,137
No.

282
00:29:11,870 --> 00:29:15,425
I'll check first, and call you later.

283
00:29:15,425 --> 00:29:16,515
And,

284
00:29:20,938 --> 00:29:25,705
don't tell Jun Seo for now.

285
00:29:25,705 --> 00:29:26,705
Don't tell him.

286
00:29:28,088 --> 00:29:29,174
Dad.

287
00:29:29,174 --> 00:29:30,454
Do as I say.

288
00:29:33,010 --> 00:29:36,163
If he knows Eun Seo is sick,

289
00:29:36,163 --> 00:29:38,070
he will lose his mind.

290
00:29:40,507 --> 00:29:44,332
We don't know for now,
but we would have to move on.

291
00:29:44,332 --> 00:29:48,174
Let's tell him when Eun Seo gets better.

292
00:29:49,164 --> 00:29:51,142
Do you understand?

293
00:29:53,877 --> 00:29:56,187
Get in a hurry to leave for the U.S.

294
00:29:56,187 --> 00:29:59,953
Jun Seo being here is not helping Eun Seo.

295
00:30:00,596 --> 00:30:01,615
Honey.

296
00:30:04,861 --> 00:30:08,703
How could you say that?

297
00:30:10,500 --> 00:30:14,544
You also shouldn't say anything
to Jun Seo for now.

298
00:30:16,684 --> 00:30:17,684
Honey.

299
00:30:19,267 --> 00:30:21,620
- Don't say another word.
- Honey.

300
00:30:22,242 --> 00:30:24,338
You know this already.

301
00:30:24,338 --> 00:30:26,173
What would happen
if Jun Seo gets to know about it?

302
00:30:26,699 --> 00:30:27,816
I don't know.

303
00:30:28,341 --> 00:30:31,840
All I know is that Eun Seo is sick.

304
00:30:32,694 --> 00:30:35,982
She is sick and dying.

305
00:30:35,982 --> 00:30:39,793
So how could you say that?

306
00:30:40,766 --> 00:30:43,411
Don't. Stop it, and let's go.

307
00:30:43,411 --> 00:30:45,019
No.

308
00:30:45,019 --> 00:30:46,268
Don't touch me.

309
00:30:47,074 --> 00:30:48,534
I'll go by myself.

310
00:30:49,386 --> 00:30:51,213
You don't deserve to meet Eun Seo.

311
00:30:51,546 --> 00:30:53,123
Ms. Kyung Ha.

312
00:30:53,123 --> 00:30:54,198
Mom.

313
00:31:04,915 --> 00:31:05,959
Professor Yoon.

314
00:31:09,667 --> 00:31:13,670
Don't say anything to Jun Seo.

315
00:31:15,603 --> 00:31:17,184
If we lose both of them,

316
00:31:18,699 --> 00:31:20,670
she and I won't even survive.

317
00:31:22,116 --> 00:31:25,048
Don't ever tell him.

318
00:31:46,064 --> 00:31:49,087
She has been unfortunate,

319
00:31:49,087 --> 00:31:50,907
and she gets into even worse situations.

320
00:31:57,864 --> 00:31:59,171
She'll be fine.

321
00:32:00,847 --> 00:32:02,523
She has to.

322
00:32:05,607 --> 00:32:07,609
Our Eun Seo will be all right.

323
00:32:10,991 --> 00:32:12,131
It'll be fine.

324
00:32:20,793 --> 00:32:22,171
Are you waiting for Tae Seok?

325
00:32:22,760 --> 00:32:23,760
Yes.

326
00:32:43,322 --> 00:32:44,644
Do you want to see who came?

327
00:32:56,857 --> 00:32:57,909
Mom.

328
00:33:46,010 --> 00:33:47,277
Are you in much pain?

329
00:33:50,210 --> 00:33:51,534
My Eun Seo.

330
00:34:00,851 --> 00:34:02,502
You got so thin.

331
00:34:05,635 --> 00:34:07,852
You should eat well.

332
00:34:08,674 --> 00:34:09,674
Yes.

333
00:34:11,001 --> 00:34:13,066
I eat well, Mom.

334
00:34:15,210 --> 00:34:18,764
Does it hurt?

335
00:34:19,386 --> 00:34:22,900
No, it doesn't hurt at all.

336
00:34:39,770 --> 00:34:41,546
We don't have water. I'll get water.

337
00:34:41,546 --> 00:34:44,276
No, I'll go.

338
00:34:56,279 --> 00:35:02,363
It is so good to have two moms, right?

339
00:35:05,831 --> 00:35:08,292
When I call out "Mom,"

340
00:35:09,777 --> 00:35:12,572
you both answer with "yes."

341
00:35:18,826 --> 00:35:19,826
Mom?

342
00:35:22,753 --> 00:35:24,114
Yes.

343
00:35:25,841 --> 00:35:29,650
Jun Seo doesn't know about this, does he?

344
00:35:34,560 --> 00:35:35,619
Eun Seo.

345
00:35:36,048 --> 00:35:37,090
He doesn't, does he?

346
00:35:39,572 --> 00:35:40,572
No.

347
00:35:44,781 --> 00:35:47,873
That's good.

348
00:35:52,499 --> 00:35:56,408
I feel so bad about making you upset, Mom.

349
00:35:57,750 --> 00:35:58,856
No.

350
00:36:01,140 --> 00:36:02,448
Eun Seo, no.

351
00:36:05,795 --> 00:36:10,891
If I...

352
00:36:13,718 --> 00:36:14,859
don't make it...

353
00:36:15,695 --> 00:36:16,779
Don't.

354
00:36:18,055 --> 00:36:21,035
Eun Seo, don't. Don't say that.

355
00:36:22,175 --> 00:36:26,817
I can't live if you're gone.

356
00:36:28,302 --> 00:36:29,884
I'll die, too.

357
00:36:32,641 --> 00:36:36,561
Because you would be lonely all alone,

358
00:36:38,063 --> 00:36:40,041
I'll follow you.

359
00:36:40,982 --> 00:36:42,356
Mom.

360
00:36:44,482 --> 00:36:46,053
Don't say that.

361
00:36:47,403 --> 00:36:48,588
I don't like that.

362
00:36:50,667 --> 00:36:52,906
Okay, Eun Seo.

363
00:36:52,906 --> 00:36:55,652
I'm sorry. I won't say it like that.

364
00:36:57,529 --> 00:36:58,604
Eun Seo.

365
00:37:23,435 --> 00:37:25,134
Is this garlic?

366
00:37:27,667 --> 00:37:28,768
Come here.

367
00:37:30,570 --> 00:37:31,709
Jun Seo.

368
00:37:32,730 --> 00:37:35,301
- You're here, Yu Mi.
- Yu Mi.

369
00:37:35,931 --> 00:37:38,841
I'm sorry.
We ran out of gas in our kitchen.

370
00:37:40,047 --> 00:37:41,553
Jun Seo hasn't come back.

371
00:37:53,740 --> 00:37:54,840
Jun Seo.

372
00:37:58,107 --> 00:38:01,319
I thought you wouldn't come back.

373
00:38:02,244 --> 00:38:03,472
Why wouldn't I?

374
00:38:06,413 --> 00:38:07,624
I'm sorry.

375
00:38:10,812 --> 00:38:11,812
I'm sorry.

376
00:38:14,557 --> 00:38:15,751
Are you worried?

377
00:38:19,205 --> 00:38:20,247
I'm sorry.

378
00:38:24,716 --> 00:38:25,776
Probably...

379
00:38:28,541 --> 00:38:30,080
Mine wouldn't match...

380
00:38:32,572 --> 00:38:34,678
since she's not my biological daughter.

381
00:38:38,940 --> 00:38:40,942
Because we have different blood types,

382
00:38:43,044 --> 00:38:44,856
I lost her.

383
00:38:47,548 --> 00:38:49,757
But I feel like they might match,

384
00:38:52,788 --> 00:38:56,711
so can I get tested?

385
00:39:00,010 --> 00:39:02,086
Since her brother's test doesn't match,

386
00:39:06,317 --> 00:39:08,255
I hope yours does.

387
00:39:10,044 --> 00:39:11,075
Yes.

388
00:39:14,168 --> 00:39:15,771
I hope so.

389
00:39:16,280 --> 00:39:19,603
If she were my biological daughter,

390
00:39:23,289 --> 00:39:26,355
it might have been easier to get surgery.

391
00:39:30,816 --> 00:39:32,558
If she were my biological daughter...

392
00:39:35,456 --> 00:39:39,829
No, not for me.

393
00:39:44,552 --> 00:39:46,101
If she weren't my daughter,

394
00:39:48,656 --> 00:39:50,060
this cancer...

395
00:39:54,023 --> 00:39:57,628
she wouldn't have had this
at such a young age.

396
00:40:01,159 --> 00:40:02,643
If she weren't my daughter...

397
00:40:06,329 --> 00:40:08,595
If she weren't my biological daughter...

398
00:41:21,020 --> 00:41:22,020
Yu Mi.

399
00:41:35,036 --> 00:41:36,199
What can I do?

400
00:41:38,516 --> 00:41:40,541
What should I do, Eun Seo?

401
00:41:43,229 --> 00:41:44,463
I'm fine.

402
00:41:45,675 --> 00:41:49,293
Yu Mi, I'll get better.

403
00:41:50,412 --> 00:41:51,902
I'll survive.

404
00:41:53,907 --> 00:41:55,882
So, don't cry.

405
00:41:59,468 --> 00:42:00,495
And...

406
00:42:01,074 --> 00:42:03,421
- Eun Seo.
- Don't tell him.

407
00:42:05,090 --> 00:42:08,414
Don't ever say it to Jun Seo.

408
00:42:11,778 --> 00:42:13,925
When he comes back from the U.S.,

409
00:42:15,570 --> 00:42:17,567
I'll tell him while smiling.

410
00:42:20,171 --> 00:42:26,311
"Jun Seo, I was very sick before."

411
00:42:28,282 --> 00:42:29,294
I'll tell him like this.

412
00:42:30,930 --> 00:42:32,076
Eun Seo.

413
00:42:32,954 --> 00:42:34,724
It's not for you.

414
00:42:36,044 --> 00:42:37,925
It's not for Jun Seo, either.

415
00:42:39,162 --> 00:42:40,740
It's for me.

416
00:42:43,730 --> 00:42:44,732
I...

417
00:42:46,738 --> 00:42:50,360
don't want him to see me like this.

418
00:42:53,012 --> 00:42:54,261
Do you understand?

419
00:42:56,435 --> 00:42:58,022
It's for me.

420
00:43:00,420 --> 00:43:01,534
I understand.

421
00:43:03,131 --> 00:43:04,252
Okay.

422
00:43:05,836 --> 00:43:07,637
Eun Seo, please live.

423
00:43:08,604 --> 00:43:13,598
You must live, and when we come back
from the U.S.,

424
00:43:13,598 --> 00:43:15,343
we will meet again.

425
00:43:17,189 --> 00:43:21,808
Please don't die like this.

426
00:43:23,652 --> 00:43:27,266
It's also for me,

427
00:43:28,470 --> 00:43:29,702
for me...

428
00:43:31,974 --> 00:43:35,006
I'll live.

429
00:43:38,646 --> 00:43:40,318
I'm getting surgery soon.

430
00:43:41,773 --> 00:43:43,089
I'll get better.

431
00:43:43,862 --> 00:43:45,023
Eun Seo.

432
00:43:48,141 --> 00:43:49,428
I'm sorry.

433
00:43:50,712 --> 00:43:51,948
I'm sorry.

434
00:43:52,977 --> 00:43:54,075
Yu Mi.

435
00:43:57,023 --> 00:44:02,504
Please make Jun Seo happy.

436
00:44:04,791 --> 00:44:08,931
That's the only thing I wish for now.

437
00:44:11,024 --> 00:44:15,448
Make him happy, please.

438
00:44:49,353 --> 00:44:50,389
Yu Mi.

439
00:44:51,666 --> 00:44:53,630
Where have you been
this early in the morning?

440
00:44:54,426 --> 00:44:56,733
I just took a walk to get fresh air.

441
00:45:00,947 --> 00:45:04,949
I've been thinking about
how I could make you happy.

442
00:45:04,949 --> 00:45:06,503
I'll make you happy.

443
00:45:11,524 --> 00:45:14,258
I'm leaving for the U.S. next semester.

444
00:45:14,258 --> 00:45:18,300
Please feel free to contact me
if you ever come to the U.S.

445
00:45:18,300 --> 00:45:20,150
I'll treat you.

446
00:45:20,962 --> 00:45:23,899
Anyway, all of you have done great work
for this semester. Good job.

447
00:45:23,899 --> 00:45:24,962
Thanks.

448
00:45:30,831 --> 00:45:31,899
Thank you.

449
00:45:38,804 --> 00:45:40,414
Let's think about good things.

450
00:45:42,839 --> 00:45:43,839
Good reasons.

451
00:45:46,100 --> 00:45:49,428
If I get five good reasons
for you to live,

452
00:45:49,428 --> 00:45:50,831
I'll do whatever I want.

453
00:45:54,468 --> 00:45:55,943
Your mom and dad.

454
00:45:58,627 --> 00:45:59,679
That's one.

455
00:46:00,795 --> 00:46:02,629
And...

456
00:46:03,882 --> 00:46:04,941
the beach.

457
00:46:06,260 --> 00:46:07,293
The beach?

458
00:46:08,186 --> 00:46:09,186
That's two.

459
00:46:10,635 --> 00:46:11,958
Making a confession.

460
00:46:14,052 --> 00:46:15,439
How did you know that?

461
00:46:17,594 --> 00:46:20,373
I have my way of knowing. That's three.

462
00:46:21,202 --> 00:46:22,527
And...

463
00:46:25,204 --> 00:46:26,287
spicy rice cakes.

464
00:46:28,060 --> 00:46:29,702
How did you know that?

465
00:46:31,514 --> 00:46:34,693
And the last one is...

466
00:46:41,929 --> 00:46:43,363
All right, why not?

467
00:46:45,137 --> 00:46:46,269
Yoon Jun Seo.

468
00:46:56,610 --> 00:47:00,748
Okay, now I will do whatever I want.

469
00:47:04,993 --> 00:47:06,491
Survive, Eun Seo.

470
00:47:10,785 --> 00:47:11,803
Don't give up.

471
00:47:15,625 --> 00:47:16,803
Please live.

472
00:47:29,466 --> 00:47:33,397
Can I say something, too?

473
00:47:36,082 --> 00:47:38,907
One more good reason for me to live.

474
00:47:42,362 --> 00:47:43,611
That is Tae Seok.

475
00:47:59,513 --> 00:48:00,587
Thank you.

476
00:48:04,882 --> 00:48:06,333
I have enough.

477
00:48:08,569 --> 00:48:09,924
What you said is enough.

478
00:48:14,401 --> 00:48:15,571
That's enough for me.

479
00:49:19,205 --> 00:49:20,205
Eun Seo.

480
00:49:22,044 --> 00:49:23,325
No.

481
00:49:23,325 --> 00:49:24,509
Eun Seo, no.

482
00:49:25,588 --> 00:49:26,662
No, Eun Seo.

483
00:49:27,397 --> 00:49:28,666
No.

484
00:49:28,666 --> 00:49:30,027
Eun Seo, no.

485
00:49:30,027 --> 00:49:31,245
No.

486
00:49:42,343 --> 00:49:43,417
It's so weird.

487
00:49:45,161 --> 00:49:47,041
It was a very strange day.

488
00:49:54,279 --> 00:49:55,330
Yu Mi.

489
00:50:01,151 --> 00:50:02,377
Jun Seo.

490
00:50:06,463 --> 00:50:08,153
Jun Seo, what should we do?

491
00:50:10,765 --> 00:50:12,906
What should we do, Jun Seo?

492
00:50:15,991 --> 00:50:17,177
Eun Seo is...

493
00:50:19,918 --> 00:50:21,111
Eun Seo?

494
00:50:21,111 --> 00:50:22,979
Eun Seo is dying.

495
00:50:24,591 --> 00:50:25,962
She is dying.

496
00:50:27,975 --> 00:50:29,459
She's in a coma.

497
00:50:33,375 --> 00:50:36,594
What do you mean?

498
00:50:41,918 --> 00:50:43,282
Why is Eun Seo in a coma?

499
00:50:44,431 --> 00:50:46,289
Eun Seo is sick.

500
00:50:47,663 --> 00:50:49,754
I lied to you.

501
00:50:51,632 --> 00:50:54,850
Jun Seo, what should we do?

502
00:50:56,039 --> 00:50:57,299
What should we do?

503
00:50:59,024 --> 00:51:00,793
What if she dies?

504
00:51:43,641 --> 00:51:45,062
(Intensive Care Unit)

505
00:51:45,857 --> 00:51:47,077
Where is Eun Seo?

506
00:51:49,522 --> 00:51:51,413
- Jun Seo.
- Jun Seo.

507
00:51:51,413 --> 00:51:53,666
Get off of me.

508
00:51:53,666 --> 00:51:56,067
- You're not allowed.
- You can't come in.

509
00:51:56,067 --> 00:51:58,271
I need to go in.

510
00:51:58,271 --> 00:51:59,306
Get off of me.

511
00:52:00,704 --> 00:52:02,187
I need to see her.

512
00:52:03,600 --> 00:52:05,089
I have something I didn't say.

513
00:52:06,480 --> 00:52:08,426
I have something I haven't told her.

514
00:52:11,975 --> 00:52:14,208
You told me to tell you
when we meet again.

515
00:52:15,694 --> 00:52:18,050
I haven't told you I love you.

516
00:52:19,054 --> 00:52:20,108
Eun Seo.

517
00:52:20,935 --> 00:52:23,025
I love you, Eun Seo.
